Exact window allocations and external-band host-payload admission.
Co-created with GPT (OpenAI), 2026-11-11. See NOTICE for project terms.

Keep FIR arithmetic unchanged while making its window scratch and coefficient
uploads exact-capacity. Admit CPU payload before claiming the output, reduce
worker slots to the supplied budget, and allocate fixed maximum row arrays.
Check RGB element indexing as well as host size_t address range.
The payload ledger is not a process RSS or Vulkan physical-memory bound.
External helpers remain outside production Pipeline.

